<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables -.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables -.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Friday that Baltimore Gas and Electric Co was not available for after-hours trading for news.</p>
<p>Earlier in the day, the company said its first-quarter earnings dropped to $0.43 a share from $0.62 for the same period last year, attributing the decline to mild weather, which held back energy demand this winter compared with the year-earlier period.</p>
<p>The exchange said Corimon SACA was also unavailable.</p>
